*> Items read but never set, and set but never read.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  NEVER-SET           PIC 9(4).
01  HAS-VALUE           PIC 9(4) VALUE 1.
01  SET-BY-MOVE         PIC 9(4).
01  WRITE-ONLY          PIC 9(4).
01  REC.
    05  REC-A           PIC X(4).
    05  REC-B           PIC X(4).
01  VIEW-SOURCE         PIC X(8).
01  VIEW REDEFINES VIEW-SOURCE.
    05  VIEW-PART       PIC X(4).
    05  FILLER          PIC X(4).
01  FLAGS.
    05  EOF-FLAG        PIC X.
        88  AT-EOF      VALUE "Y".
01  PARAM               PIC X(10).
01  COUNTER             PIC 9(4).
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01  LOCAL-TEMP          PIC 9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY NEVER-SET HAS-VALUE
    MOVE 5 TO SET-BY-MOVE
    DISPLAY SET-BY-MOVE
    MOVE 7 TO WRITE-ONLY
    MOVE SPACES TO REC
    DISPLAY REC-A
    MOVE "ABCDEFGH" TO VIEW-SOURCE
    DISPLAY VIEW-PART
    SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
    IF AT-EOF DISPLAY "DONE" END-IF
    CALL "SUB" USING PARAM
    DISPLAY PARAM
    ADD 1 TO COUNTER
    DISPLAY LOCAL-TEMP
    STOP RUN.
